(1,1,'2024-11-17 18:21:23','2024-11-17 18:21:23','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Jinsi ya Kuongeza Manual Price Tiers kwa Huduma Yako kwenye WINGA</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kuongeza <em>price tiers</em> (vipengele vya bei) ni njia nzuri ya kuwapa wateja wako chaguo tofauti kulingana na bajeti na huduma wanazohitaji. Hapa kuna mwongozo wa hatua kwa hatua juu ya jinsi ya kuongeza <em>price tiers</em> kwa huduma zako, tukitumia mfano wa <strong>Website Development</strong>:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua 1: Nenda kwenye Sehemu ya \" Tiers\"</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Baada ya kuingia kwenye akaunti yako ya WINGA na kuanza kutuma huduma unayotoa ,katika vepengele vya kujaza kukamilisha huduma unayotoa utaona sehemu ya <em>Tier</em>s. Hapa ndipo unapotengeneza vifurushi tofauti vya bei (<em>Basic</em>, <em>Standard</em>, <em>Premium</em>) kwa huduma yako.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua 2: Unda Package ya Kwanza - Basic</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Basic</strong> ni kiwango cha chini zaidi kinachofaa wateja wanaohitaji huduma za msingi.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Title (Jina):</strong> Basic</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Price (Bei):</strong> Tsh 200,000</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Description (Maelezo):</strong> Basic website setup with 3 pages (Home, About, Contact). Includes a responsive design and basic SEO.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bonyeza <em>Add Item</em> baada ya kujaza maelezo haya.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua 3: Unda Package ya Pili - Standard</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Standard</strong> ni kiwango cha kati kinachojumuisha huduma za ziada kuliko <em>Basic</em>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Title (Jina):</strong> Standard</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Price (Bei):</strong> Tsh 400,000</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Description (Maelezo):</strong> Fully customized website with up to 7 pages. Includes responsive design, SEO optimization, and integration of contact forms.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Baada ya kuongeza maelezo haya, bonyeza <em>Add Item</em>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua 4: Unda Package ya Tatu - Premium</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Premium</strong> ni kiwango cha juu zaidi kinachofaa wateja wanaohitaji huduma kamili na za kitaalam zaidi.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Title (Jina):</strong> Premium</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Price (Bei):</strong> Tsh 800,000</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Description (Maelezo):</strong> Advanced website with unlimited pages, e-commerce integration, advanced SEO, analytics setup, and 1-month maintenance support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bonyeza <em>Add Item</em> mara baada ya kuandika maelezo haya.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua 5: Hakikisha Maelezo ya Packages Yako</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Angalia tena maelezo ya <em>price tiers</em> zako tatu ili kuhakikisha kila moja inaeleweka vizuri. Hakikisha unatoa maelezo ya wazi kwa kila kiwango, na kila huduma inayojumuishwa.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua 6: Hakiki na Chapisha</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mara baada ya kumaliza kuongeza <em>price tiers</em> zako, hakikisha kila kitu kipo sahihi. Bonyeza <em>Publish</em> ili huduma yako iweze kuonekana na kuvutia wateja.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mfano wa Listing ya Huduma: Website Development</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Service Title:</strong><br>\"I Will Develop a Professional and Responsive Website for Your Business\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Category:</strong><br>Creative and Digital → Website Development</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Price Tiers:</strong><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Basic:</strong> Tsh 200,000 - Basic website setup with 3 pages (Home, About, Contact). Includes a responsive design and basic SEO.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Standard:</strong> Tsh 400,000 - Fully customized website with up to 7 pages. Includes responsive design, SEO optimization, and integration of contact forms.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Premium:</strong> Tsh 800,000 - Advanced website with unlimited pages, e-commerce integration, advanced SEO, analytics setup, and 1-month maintenance support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Service Image:</strong><br>Picha ya mfano wa tovuti iliyo tayari au screenshot ya design ya kipekee.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Service Description:</strong><br>\"I will design and develop a professional website that meets your business needs. Whether you need a simple informational site or an advanced e-commerce platform, I deliver quality work tailored to your goals. All websites are responsive, SEO-optimized, and include support for analytics setup to track your website performance.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Faida za Kuweka <em>Price Tiers</em></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Wateja Wanapata Chaguo:</strong> Wateja wanaweza kuchagua huduma inayofaa kulingana na bajeti na mahitaji yao.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Kuongeza Mapato:</strong> Vipengele vya bei tofauti hukupa nafasi ya kuvutia wateja wa viwango vyote.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Kuhakikisha Uwazi:</strong> Maelezo ya <em>price tiers</em> yanawapa wateja taarifa ya wazi juu ya huduma wanayopata kwa kila bei.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sasa unaweza kuunda na kuchapisha huduma zako kwa mafanikio kwenye WINGA. Weka <em>price tiers</em> zako vizuri ili kuvutia wateja na kupata mapato zaidi. <strong>Anza sasa kwa kubonyeza hapa:</strong><br>👉 <a href=\"https://wingatz.com/submit-listing/details\">Submit Listing on WINGA</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Jinsi ya Kuongeza package za huduma (Basic, standard, Premium)','Kuongeza vipengele vya bei ni njia nzuri ya kuwapa wateja wako machaguo tofauti.........','publish','open','open','','online-job-in-tanzania','','','2024-12-21 16:03:18','2024-12-21 16:03:18','',0,'http://wingatz.com/?p=1',0,'post','',0),
(3,1,'2024-11-17 18:21:23','2024-11-17 18:21:23','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our website address is: http://wingatz.com.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\"> </strong>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor’s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https://automattic.com/privacy/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\"> </strong>If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\"> </strong>If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select \"Remember Me\", your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded content from other websites</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\"> </strong>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we share your data with</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\"> </strong>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long we retain your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\"> </strong>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What rights you have over your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\"> </strong>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where your data is sent</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\"> </strong>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Privacy Policy','','publish','closed','open','','privacy-policy','','','2024-12-21 11:24:37','2024-12-21 11:24:37','',0,'http://wingatz.com/?page_id=3',0,'page','',0),
