(38,1,'2021-01-18 16:36:41','2021-01-18 16:36:41','<em>\"Hiring WINGA for my house construction project was the best decision I made. They handled everything—from sourcing materials to supervising workers—with professionalism and care. Despite being away, I felt completely at ease knowing the project was in good hands. The updates were timely, and the quality of work exceeded my expectations. Highly recommend their project supervision services!\"</em>\r\n— Carlos Kapinga<strong>, Homeowner</strong>','Carlos Kapinga','','publish','closed','closed','','sandra-lockhart','','','2024-11-19 19:57:05','2024-11-19 19:57:05','',0,'https://experthive.hivepress.io/?post_type=hp_testimonial&#038;p=38',0,'hp_testimonial','',0),
(40,1,'2021-01-17 16:37:06','2021-01-17 16:37:06','<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"7b92c58f-f631-4155-a424-cd034620a413\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\r\n\r\n<em>\"Working with WINGA has been an amazing experience! The platform connects me with clients who need my help, and I love being able to assist with tasks like document processing and errands. The system is easy to use, payments are secure, and I’ve built great relationships with clients who trust my work. It feels good to make a difference while growing my own skills and income!\"</em>\r\n— <strong>Christian Nyaganga, WINGA Service Provider</strong>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mb-2 flex gap-3 empty:hidden -ml-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center pb-0\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>','Christian Nyaganga','','publish','closed','closed','','thomas-hinton','','','2024-11-19 19:44:00','2024-11-19 19:44:00','',0,'https://experthive.hivepress.io/?post_type=hp_testimonial&#038;p=40',0,'hp_testimonial','',0),
(41,1,'2021-01-17 16:37:15','2021-01-17 16:37:15','<em>WINGA made processing my documents hassle-free! I needed assistance with some paperwork while I was out of town, and the professional I hired handled everything quickly and efficiently. The platform’s secure system and easy communication gave me peace of mind throughout the process. I’ll definitely use WINGA again for tasks like this!\"</em>\r\n— Aloyce Massawe<strong>, Satisfied User</strong>','Aloyce Massawe','','publish','closed','closed','','michelle-foster','','','2024-11-19 13:03:29','2024-11-19 13:03:29','',0,'https://experthive.hivepress.io/?post_type=hp_testimonial&#038;p=41',0,'hp_testimonial','',0),
