(314,1,'2024-12-08 14:51:07','2024-12-08 14:51:07','<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"8f035137-805b-4491-b72b-e36d3fcc9ebb\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\n\nEnjoy the convenience of a professional haircut without leaving your home with our <strong>Home Haircut Service</strong>. Whether it’s a stylish trim, a new look, or simple grooming, our skilled stylists provide salon-quality services tailored to your needs.\n\n<strong>What We Offer:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Haircuts for men, women, and children.</li>\n 	<li>Beard trimming and facial hair grooming.</li>\n 	<li>Customized styles for casual or special occasions.</li>\n 	<li>Hygienic tools and a comfortable, at-home experience.</li>\n</ul>\nBook today for a fresh, polished look right in the comfort of your home!\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-2 flex gap-3 empty:hidden -ml-2\">\n<div class=\"items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"flex\"></div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center pb-0\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>','Professional in-home haircuts','','inherit','closed','closed','','175-autosave-v1','','','2024-12-08 14:51:07','2024-12-08 14:51:07','',175,'https://wingatz.com/?p=314',0,'revision','',0),
