(336,4,'2024-11-18 09:59:09','2024-11-18 09:59:09','<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"faac0412-aa35-4180-b3eb-2861e99dc7c0\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\r\n\r\n🏠 <strong>Nahitaji mtaalamu wa kusimamia ujenzi wa nyumba yangu!</strong>\r\n\r\nMajukumu yanayohitajika:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Kusimamia wafanyakazi wa ujenzi na kuhakikisha kazi inafanyika kwa wakati.</li>\r\n 	<li>Kuangalia ubora wa vifaa na kazi.</li>\r\n 	<li>Kutoa ripoti za maendeleo ya ujenzi mara kwa mara.</li>\r\n 	<li>Kusimamia bajeti na matumizi ya rasilimali.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n📍 <strong>Eneo:</strong> eneo la ujenzi kibaha kwa mathias\r\n📅 <strong>Tarehe ya Kuanzia:</strong> 03-01-2025\r\n\r\nKama una uzoefu wa usimamizi wa miradi ya ujenzi na unatoa huduma bora, tafadhali wasiliana nami mara moja ili tupange kazi hii! 🙌\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>','Kusaidiwa usimamizi wa kujenga nyumba','','publish','closed','closed','','kusaidiwa-usimamizi-wa-kujenga-nyumba','','','2024-12-09 11:09:01','2024-12-09 11:09:01','',0,'https://wingatz.com/?post_type=hp_request&#038;p=336',0,'hp_request','',2),
