t and a worker:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Users are encouraged to resolve disputes amicably through the platform’s messaging system.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If unresolved, WINGA will mediate based on available evidence (e.g., messages, submitted work).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>WINGA’s decision in disputes is final.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>10. Liability and Indemnity</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>WINGA is not liable for the quality of services provided by workers or the accuracy of job postings by clients.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Users agree to indemnify WINGA from any claims, damages, or losses arising from their use of the platform.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>11. Privacy Policy</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WINGA values your privacy. By using the platform, you agree to our data collection and usage practices as outlined in our <strong>Privacy Policy</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>12. Termination</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>WINGA may terminate or suspend access to the platform for users who violate these Terms and Conditions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Users may deactivate their accounts at any time by contacting support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>13. Governing Law</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These Terms and Conditions are governed by the laws of the United Republic of Tanzania.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>14. Amendments</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WINGA reserves the right to amend these Terms and Conditions at any time. Users will be notified of significant changes via email or platform notifications.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>15. Contact Information</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For questions or concerns regarding these Terms and Conditions, contact us at:<br><strong>Email:</strong> <a>info@winga.c</a>om<br><strong>Phone:</strong> +255 (0) 789746608<br><strong>Address:</strong> Dar es Salaam, Tanzania</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Terms and Conditions','','inherit','closed','closed','','501-revision-v1','','','2024-11-22 11:33:02','2024-11-22 11:33:02','',501,'https://wingatz.com/?p=504',0,'revision','',0),
