(617,1,'2024-12-03 15:51:36','2024-12-03 15:51:36','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About us</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to <strong>WINGA</strong>, your trusted platform for connecting skilled professionals and reliable service providers with clients across Tanzania and beyond.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At WINGA, we understand the challenges people face when managing tasks, projects, or emergencies—especially when time is limited, or finding trusted help seems impossible. Whether you’re building your dream home, seeking digital expertise, or handling family responsibilities from afar, WINGA is here to simplify your journey.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Our Story</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WINGA was inspired by a deeply Tanzanian concept: the \"winga\"—a resourceful and reliable intermediary who helps people navigate complex markets or manage various tasks with ease. Our founder,  envisioned WINGA as a digital version of this concept.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This experience highlighted a common need among Tanzanians: a dependable platform to find skilled professionals who can handle tasks when you don’t know where to start or simply don’t have the time. Whether you\'re within Tanzania or living abroad, WINGA is your solution for getting things done efficiently, transparently, and stress-free.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What We Do</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We bridge the gap between those who need services and those who offer them by providing:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Diverse Services:</strong> From home repairs to digital marketing, creative projects, and health care support, we cater to a wide range of needs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Trusted Professionals:</strong> Verified service providers with ratings and reviews to ensure quality and reliability.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Secure Transactions:</strong> Seamless payment integration for safe and transparent service completion.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Flexibility and Accessibility:</strong> A user-friendly platform accessible to anyone, anytime.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Vision</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To empower individuals and businesses by creating a trusted, efficient, and inclusive marketplace that fosters opportunity and growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Mission</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To connect Tanzanians and beyond with skilled professionals, simplify access to services, and enhance lives by enabling people to accomplish more together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Choose WINGA?</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Convenience:</strong> Access skilled professionals quickly and easily.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Reliability:</strong> Verified workers ensure your trust and peace of mind.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Flexibility:</strong> Services tailored to your budget, timeline, and preferences.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Community Impact:</strong> Supporting local talent and creating opportunities for growth.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Join us in redefining how tasks get done in Tanzania. Whether you’re a client with a job to offer or a professional ready to showcase your skills, WINGA is the platform for you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Contact Us</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have questions or need assistance? Reach out to us anytime:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Email:</strong> <a>info@wingatz.com</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Phone:</strong> +255 674939514</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Instagram:</strong> @wingatanzania</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>facebook</strong>: @winga tanzania</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let’s make your tasks easier, faster, and more reliable—<strong>Together with WINGA</strong>, Your best personal assistant</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','About us','','publish','closed','closed','','about-us','','','2024-12-13 15:56:40','2024-12-13 15:56:40','',0,'https://wingatz.com/?page_id=617',0,'page','',0),
