(625,17,'2024-12-09 08:33:54','2024-12-09 08:33:54','&nbsp;\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"051e9256-84b4-44a0-b1aa-576009d5adb9\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\r\n\r\nI am a professional <strong>photographer</strong>, <strong>graphic designer</strong>, and <strong>video editor/shooter</strong>, with expertise in creating eye-catching visuals and stunning media content. Whether you\'re looking for creative advertisement designs, professional-grade photos, or high-quality video production, I’m here to bring your vision to life.\r\n\r\n<strong>Services I Offer:</strong>\r\n📸 <strong>Photography:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Event photography (weddings, birthdays, corporate events).</li>\r\n 	<li>Portraits and headshots.</li>\r\n 	<li>Product photography for e-commerce.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n🎥 <strong>Video Editing &amp; Shooting:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Promotional videos and advertisements.</li>\r\n 	<li>Event coverage.</li>\r\n 	<li>Social media reels and short videos.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n🎨 <strong>Graphic Design:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Logo creation.</li>\r\n 	<li>Branding and visual identity.</li>\r\n 	<li>Social media posts and banner designs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n💼 <strong>Advertisement Services:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Creative ad concept development.</li>\r\n 	<li>Graphic and video ad production.</li>\r\n 	<li>Campaign visuals tailored for social media and print.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nLet’s work together to deliver stunning results that leave a lasting impact. Contact me today to discuss your project and get started!\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\nEmail- haidarimtipa25@gm