(739,1,'2024-12-13 14:19:55','2024-12-13 14:19:55','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About us</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to <strong>WINGA</strong>, your trusted platform for connecting skilled professionals and reliable service providers with clients across Tanzania and beyond.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At WINGA, we understand the challenges people face when managing tasks, projects, or emergencies—especially when time is limited, or finding trusted help seems impossible. Whether you’re building your dream home, seeking digital expertise, or handling family responsibilities from afar, WINGA is here to simplify your journey.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Our Story</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WINGA was inspired by a deeply Tanzanian concept: the \"winga\"—a resourceful and reliable intermediary who helps people navigate complex markets or manage various tasks with ease. Our founder,  envisioned WINGA as a digital version of this concept.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This experience highlighted a common need among Tanzanians: a dependable platform to find skilled professionals who can handle tasks when you don’t know where to start or simply don’t have the time. Whether you\'re within Tanzania or living abroad, WINGA is your solution for getting things done efficiently, transparently, and stress-free.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What We Do</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We bridge the gap between those who need services and those who offer them by providing:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Diverse Services:</strong> From home repairs to digital marketing, creative projects, and health care support, we cater to a wide range of needs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Trusted Professionals:</strong> Verified service providers with ratings and reviews to ensure quality and reliability.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Secure Transactions:</strong> Seamless payment integration for safe and transparent service completion.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Flexibility and Accessibility:</strong> A user-friendly platform accessible to anyone, anytime.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Vision</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To empower individuals and businesses by creating a trusted, efficient, and inclusive marketplace that fosters opportunity and growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Mission</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To connect Tanzanians and beyond with skilled professionals, simplify access to services, and enhance lives by enabling people to accomplish more together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Choose WINGA?</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Convenience:</strong> Access skilled professionals quickly and easily.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Reliability:</strong> Verified workers ensure your trust and peace of mind.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Flexibility:</strong> Services tailored to your budget, timeline, and preferences.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Community Impact:</strong> Supporting local talent and creating opportunities for growth.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Join us in redefining how tasks get done in Tanzania. Whether you’re a client with a job to offer or a professional ready to showcase your skills, WINGA is the platform for you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Contact Us</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have questions or need assistance? Reach out to us anytime:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Email:</strong> <a>info@wingatz.com</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Phone:</strong> +255 674939514</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Instagram:</strong> @wingatanzania</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>facebook</strong>: @winga tanzania</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let’s make your tasks easier, faster, and more reliable—<strong>Together with WINGA</strong>, Your best personal assistant</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','About us','','inherit','closed','closed','','617-revision-v1','','','2024-12-13 14:19:55','2024-12-13 14:19:55','',617,'https://wingatz.com/?p=739',0,'revision','',0),
(740,1,'2024-12-13 16:04:02','2024-12-13 16:04:02','Are you overwhelmed by the process of finding the perfect job, whether remote or onsite? Let me handle it for you! With my expertise as a job search specialist, I ensure a smooth and efficient job search process tailored to your preferences, skills, and career goals.\r\n<h4><strong>Services I Offer:</strong></h4>\r\n1️⃣ <strong>Personalized Job Search:</strong>\r\nI will conduct a detailed job search on your behalf, utilizing various job boards, websites, and platforms to identify the best opportunities that align with your qualifications and interests.\r\n\r\n2️⃣ <strong>Application Tracking:</strong>\r\nOrganization is key! I will provide you with a detailed Excel sheet that tracks your job applications. This includes job titles, company names, application dates, current statuses, and any necessary follow-up actions to keep your applications on track.\r\n\r\nTsh 100,000/= 15 jobs,    1 job for 10,000tsh\r\n<h4><strong>Why Choose My Service?</strong></h4>\r\n✔️ <strong>24/7 Support:</strong> I’m always available to answer your questions and address concerns promptly.\r\n✔️ <strong>Extensive Experience:</strong> With over 7 years of experience in job search and application processes, I’ll guide you seamlessly through the journey.\r\n✔️ <strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Focus on your priorities while I handle the tedious work of finding and applying for jobs.\r\n<h4><strong>What I Need From You:</strong></h4>\r\n📌 A CV and cover letter.\r\n📌 Basic information about your job preferences, including location, industry, and role types.\r\n\r\nLet’s work together to find your next career opportunity! Contact me today to get started.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nSWAHILI\r\n\r\nJe, unachoshwa na mchakato wa kutafuta kazi bora, iwe ya mtandaoni au ya ofisini? Niachie kazi hiyo! Kama mtaalamu wa utafutaji wa kazi, nitahakikisha unapata kazi inayolingana na mapendeleo, ujuzi, na malengo yako ya taaluma kwa urahisi na ufanisi.\r\n<h4><strong>Huduma Ninazotoa:</strong></h4>\r\n1️⃣ <strong>Utafutaji wa Kazi Mahususi:</strong>\r\nNitafanya utafiti wa kina kwenye majukwaa mbalimbali ya kazi, tovuti, na bodi za kazi, nikitafuta nafasi zinazolingana na sifa na maslahi yako.\r\n\r\n2️⃣ <strong>Ufuatiliaji wa Maombi:</strong>\r\nMpangilio bora wa maombi ni muhimu! Nitakupa faili ya Excel inayorekodi maombi yako yote, ikijumuisha: jina la kazi, kampuni, tarehe ya maombi, hali ya maombi, na hatua za kufuatilia.\r\n\r\nkazi 15 kwa tsh 100,000/=,  kazi moja 10,000/=\r\n<h4><strong>Kwa Nini Unichague?</strong></h4>\r\n✔️ <strong>Msaada wa Saa 24/7:</strong> Nipo tayari kujibu maswali na kushughulikia wasiwasi wako wakati wowote.\r\n✔️ <strong>Uzoefu Mkubwa:</strong> Nikiwa na uzoefu wa zaidi ya miaka 7 katika mchakato wa utafutaji wa kazi, nitakusaidia kwa maarifa ya kitaalamu na ufanisi.\r\n✔️ <strong>Kuokoa Muda:</strong> Jihusishe na mambo mengine muhimu wakati nikiwa nafanya kazi ya kutafuta na kutuma maombi kwa niaba yako.\r\n<h4><strong>Ninachohitaji Kutoka Kwako:</strong></h4>\r\n📌 CV na barua ya maombi.\r\n📌 Maelezo ya msingi kama aina ya kazi unayotaka, eneo, na sekta unayopendelea.\r\n\r\nTushirikiane leo ili upate nafasi ya kazi unayostahili! Wasiliana nami kuanza safari yako ya ajira.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','I will search and apply for jobs on your behalf  ( Natoa huduma ya Utafutaji na kukufanyia maombi ya Kazi)','Category: Administrative; Tags: Administor, ajira; Vendor: frank k..','publish','closed','closed','','i-will-search-and-apply-for-remote-jobs-onsite-jobs-or-any-job-application','','','2024-12-13 16:23:39','2024-12-13 16:23:39','',57,'https://wingatz.com/?post_type=hp_listing&#038;p=740',0,'hp_listing','',0),
