(742,1,'2024-12-13 16:08:35','2024-12-13 16:08:35','Are you overwhelmed by the process of finding the perfect job, whether remote or onsite? Let me handle it for you! With my expertise as a job search specialist, I ensure a smooth and efficient job search process tailored to your preferences, skills, and career goals.\n<h4><strong>Services I Offer:</strong></h4>\n1️⃣ <strong>Personalized Job Search:</strong>\nI will conduct a detailed job search on your behalf, utilizing various job boards, websites, and platforms to identify the best opportunities that align with your qualifications and interests.\n\n2️⃣ <strong>Application Tracking:</strong>\nOrganization is key! I will provide you with a detailed Excel sheet that tracks your job applications. This includes job titles, company names, application dates, current statuses, and any necessary follow-up actions to keep your applications on track.\n\nTsh 100,000/= 15 jobs,    1 job for 10,000tsh\n<h4><strong>Why Choose My Service?</strong></h4>\n✔️ <strong>24/7 Support:</strong> I’m always available to answer your questions and address concerns promptly.\n✔️ <strong>Extensive Experience:</strong> With over 7 years of experience in job search and application processes, I’ll guide you seamlessly through the journey.\n✔️ <strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Focus on your priorities while I handle the tedious work of finding and applying for jobs.\n<h4><strong>What I Need From You:</strong></h4>\n📌 A CV and cover letter.\n📌 Basic information about your job preferences, including location, industry, and role types.\n\nLet’s work together to find your next career opportunity! Contact me today to get started.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nSWAHILI\n\nJe, unachoshwa na mchakato wa kutafuta kazi bora, iwe ya mtandaoni au ya ofisini? Niachie kazi hiyo! Kama mtaalamu wa utafutaji wa kazi, nitahakikisha unapata kazi inayolingana na mapendeleo, ujuzi, na malengo yako ya taaluma kwa urahisi na ufanisi.\n<h4><strong>Huduma Ninazotoa:</strong></h4>\n1️⃣ <strong>Utafutaji wa Kazi Mahususi:</strong>\nNitafanya utafiti wa kina kwenye majukwaa mbalimbali ya kazi, tovuti, na bodi za kazi, nikitafuta nafasi zinazolingana na sifa na maslahi yako.\n\n2️⃣ <strong>Ufuatiliaji wa Maombi:</strong>\nMpangilio bora wa maombi ni muhimu! Nitakupa faili ya Excel inayorekodi maombi yako yote, ikijumuisha: jina la kazi, kampuni, tarehe ya maombi, hali ya maombi, na hatua za kufuatilia.\n\nkazi 15 kwa tsh 100,000/=,  kazi moja 10,000/=\n<h4><strong>Kwa Nini Unichague?</strong></h4>\n✔️ <strong>Msaada wa Saa 24/7:</strong> Nipo tayari kujibu maswali na kushughulikia wasiwasi wako wakati wowote.\n✔️ <strong>Uzoefu Mkubwa:</strong> Nikiwa na uzoefu wa zaidi ya miaka 7 katika mchakato wa utafutaji wa kazi, nitakusaidia kwa maarifa ya kitaalamu na ufanisi.\n✔️ <strong>Kuokoa Muda:</strong> Jihusishe na mambo mengine muhimu wakati nikiwa nafanya kazi ya kutafuta na kutuma maombi kwa niaba yako.\n<h4><strong>Ninachohitaji Kutoka Kwako:</strong></h4>\n📌 CV na barua ya maombi.\n📌 Maelezo ya msingi kama aina ya kazi unayotaka, eneo, na sekta unayopendelea.\n\nTushirikiane leo ili upate nafasi ya kazi unayostahili! Wasiliana nami kuanza safari yako ya ajira.\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;','I will search and apply for jobs on your behalf  (Huduma ya Utafutaji na Maombi ya Kazi)','','inherit','closed','closed','','740-autosave-v1','','','2024-12-13 16:08:35','2024-12-13 16:08:35','',740,'https://wingatz.com/?p=742',0,'revision','',0),
(743,2,'2024-12-13 20:08:24','2024-12-13 20:08:24','With over 7 years of experience and a solid academic background, I specialize in conducting market research, developing business plans, and performing competitor analysis to help startups and SMEs succeed.\r\n<h4><strong>Qualifications:</strong></h4>\r\n🎓 Bachelor of Commerce – University of Dar es salaam  (East and Central Africa\'s leading university).\r\n🎓 Master of Science in Entrepreneurship and Innovations Management – University of Dar es salaam.\r\n<h4><strong>What I Offer:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Market Research:</strong> In-depth analysis of prevailing market trends, conditions, opportunities, and threats.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Business Plans:</strong> Tailored plans that outline strategic market positioning, pricing, branding, and marketing approaches.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Competitor Analysis:</strong> Insights to help you identify opportunities and stand out in a competitive landscape.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Expansion Strategies:</strong> Effective techniques for market penetration and growth.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Who Is This For?</strong></h4>\r\nI assist startups and SMEs in navigating market complexities, finding the best strategies to apply, and building a strong foundation for growth and success.\r\n\r\nLet me help your business seize opportunities and overcome challenges with professional guidance and expertise.\r\n\r\n📩 Contact me today to get started!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>SWAHILI</strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nNikiwa na uzoefu wa zaidi ya miaka 7 na msingi imara wa kitaaluma, ninajihusisha na kufanya utafiti wa soko, kuandaa mipango ya biashara, na kuchambua ushindani ili kusaidia startups na SMEs kufanikiwa.\r\n<h4><strong>Sifa Zangu:</strong></h4>\r\n🎓 Shahada ya Biashara – Chuo Kikuu cha Dar es salaam (chuo kinachoongoza Afrika Mashariki na Kati).\r\n🎓 Shahada ya Uzamili ya Sayansi katika Ujasiriamali na Usimamizi wa Ubunifu – Chuo Kikuu cha Dar es salaam.\r\n<h4><strong>Huduma Ninazotoa:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Utafiti wa Soko:</strong> Uchambuzi wa kina wa hali ya soko, fursa, changamoto, na vitisho vilivyopo.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mipango ya Biashara:</strong> Mpango maalum wa kibiashara unaoeleza mbinu za uwekaji sokoni, bei, chapa, na masoko.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Uchambuzi wa Ushindani:</strong> Maarifa ya kukusaidia kutambua fursa na kushindana kwa ufanisi.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mikakati ya Upanuzi:</strong> Njia bora za kupenya sokoni na kukuza biashara yako.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Huduma Hizi Ni Kwa Ajili Ya Nani?</strong></h4>\r\nNinasaidia startups na biashara ndogo kuelewa hali ya soko, kutambua mikakati bora ya kutumia, na kujenga msingi madhubuti wa ukuaji na mafanikio.\r\n\r\n📩 Wasiliana nami leo ili tuanze safari ya mafanikio ya biashara yako!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','i will do Market Research and Business Plan for your business or startup( nafanya  Utafiti wa Soko na Mpango wa Biashara au startup)','Category: Project supervision; Tags: ; Vendor: Winga Support Team.','publish','closed','closed','','i-will-do-market-research-and-business-plan-for-your-business-or-startup-nafanya-utafiti-wa-soko-na-mpango-wa-biashara-au-startup','','','2024-12-25 10:56:49','2024-12-25 10:56:49','',321,'https://wingatz.com/?post_type=hp_listing&#038;p=743',0,'hp_listing','',0),
