(878,1,'2024-12-21 15:22:38','2024-12-21 15:22:38','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Jinsi ya Kupost Huduma Yako kwa Ufanisi kwenye WINGA </strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Je, unataka kuanza kupata mapato kwa kutoa huduma zako kwenye <strong>WINGA</strong>? Hapa kuna mwongozo wa haraka wa kupost huduma yako.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 1: Nenda kwenye \"List a Service\" (Go to \"List a Service\")</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kwenda kwenye <strong>List a Service</strong> na jaza maelezo muhimu ya huduma yako.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 2: Jaza Jina la Huduma (Fill in the Service Title)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Taja huduma yako kwa ufasaha na maneno ya kutafuta.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mfano:</strong><br>“I Will Write a Professional CV Tailored to Your Career Goals”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 3: Chagua Kategoria (Choose a Category)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Chagua kategoria inayofaa, kama <strong>Writing and Translation</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 4: Weka Bei (Set Your Price)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Chagua bei kwa kila tier ya huduma yako.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mfano:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Basic:</strong> Tsh 10,000 - Simple CV layout</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Standard:</strong> Tsh 20,000 - Customized CV with industry-specific content</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Premium:</strong> Tsh 30,000 - Executive-level CV with LinkedIn optimization and cover letter</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 5: Pakia Picha ya Huduma (Upload a Service Image)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pakia picha inayohusiana na huduma yako.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 6: Chagua wa huduma kukamilika (Choose Delivery Time)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Taja muda wa utoaji, kama <strong>up to 24 hours</strong>, <strong>2-3 days</strong>, au <strong>4-7 days</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 7: Chagua Chaguzi za Marekebisho (Select Revision Options)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Chagua idadi ya marekebisho unayotoa.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mfano:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>1 revision</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>2 revisions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Unlimited revisions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 8: Chagua Upatikanaji Wako (Set Your Availability)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Weka upatikanaji wako kwa wateja.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 9: Chagua Chaguo la Dhamana (Choose Warranty Option)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Chagua ikiwa utatoa dhamana kwa huduma yako.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 10: Andika Maelezo ya Huduma (Write a Service Description)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Elezea huduma yako na faida zake.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mfano:</strong><br>“I will craft a professional CV that highlights your skills and achievements, tailored specifically to your career goals. Whether you’re applying for an entry-level job or looking to secure an executive position, I create CVs that make you stand out.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 11: Chapisha Huduma Yako (Publish Your Service)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Baada ya kuangalia tena, bonyeza <strong>Publish</strong> na huduma yako itakuwa hai.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mfano wa Huduma ya Uandishi wa CV:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Basic:</strong> Tsh 10,000 - Simple CV layout (3-5 business days, 1 revision)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Standard:</strong> Tsh 20,000 - Customized CV with industry-specific content (2-3 business days, 2 revisions)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Premium:</strong> Tsh 30,000 - Executive-level CV with LinkedIn optimization and cover letter (24 hours, unlimited revisions)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Picha ya Huduma:</strong> Picha ya muundo wa resume mzuri<br><strong>Upatikanaji:</strong> 1 day notice<br><strong>Dhamana:</strong> Full warranty<br><strong>Maelezo:</strong> “I will craft a professional CV that highlights your skills and achievements...”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vidokezo vya Mafanikio (Final Tips for Success):</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Jibu haraka kwa wateja na toa kazi ya ubora.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tumia lugha ya kuvutia kwa maelezo yako.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Weka bei yako kwa ushindani lakini iakisi thamani unayoleta.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Wakati wa kuanza!</strong> Bonyeza hapa ku <strong>List a Service</strong> <br><a href=\"https://wingatz.com/submit-listing/details\">https://wingatz.com/submit-listing/details</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Jinsi ya Kupost Huduma Yako kwa Ufanisi kwenye WINGA','Hiring the right project supervisor on WINGA is simple.','inherit','closed','closed','','50-revision-v1','','','2024-12-21 15:22:38','2024-12-21 15:22:38','',50,'https://wingatz.com/?p=878',0,'revision','',0),
(879,1,'2024-12-21 15:26:38','2024-12-21 15:26:38','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you ready to offer your expertise and start earning on <strong>WINGA</strong>? Listing your service effectively can make all the difference in attracting clients. Here’s a simple guide to help you create a winning service listing that stands out.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 1: Go to \"List a Service\"</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To start, click <strong>List a Service</strong> ( Become a winga). This is where you’ll enter all the necessary information to showcase your service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 2: Fill in the Service Title</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your <strong>service title</strong> should clearly describe what you’re offering. Be specific and use keywords that potential clients might search for.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Example:</strong><br>“I Will Write a Professional CV Tailored to Your Career Goals”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 3: Choose a Category</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Select the <strong>category</strong> that best fits your service. For instance, if you’re offering writing services, choose <strong>Writting and translation</strong>  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Example:</strong><br><strong>Category:</strong> Writing and translation<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 4: Set Your Price</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now, determine how much you’d like to charge for your service. WINGA offers <strong>Basic</strong>, <strong>Standard</strong>, and <strong>Premium</strong> price tiers, allowing you to set different prices based on the service level. ( to do this click on price tier and add <strong>basic</strong> then its price and description and same to <strong>Standard</strong> and <strong>premium</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Example:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Basic:</strong>Tsh 10,000 - Simple CV layout,</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Standard:</strong> Tsh 20,000 - Customized CV with industry-specific content</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Premium:</strong> Tsh 30,000 - Executive-level CV with LinkedIn optimization and a cover letter</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 5: Upload a Service Image</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A <strong>clear, high-quality image</strong> helps potential clients visualize your service. If you’re offering a design service, upload a portfolio image. For writing or consulting services, a professional headshot or a relevant image will work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 6: Choose Delivery Time</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Select the <strong>delivery time</strong>  This helps set expectations with your clients on how soon they can expect the service to be completed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Example</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>up to 24 hours, 2-3 days , 4-7 days</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 7: Select Revision Options</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>How many revisions do you offer? This will vary depending on the tier you choose. Offering revisions ensures client satisfaction.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Example:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> 1 revision , 2 revisions ,Unlimited revisions</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 8: Set Your Availability</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choose your <strong>availability</strong> for when clients can expect you to respond and complete tasks. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 9: Warranty Option</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For services like product design or development, offering a <strong>warranty</strong> can give clients peace of mind. You can choose whether to provide a warranty for your work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 10: Write a  Service Description</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now, describe your service in detail. Highlight what makes you unique and why clients should choose your service over others. Be sure to mention the key benefits and outcomes of working with you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Example Description:</strong><br>\"I will craft a professional CV that highlights your skills and achievements, tailored specifically to your career goals. Whether you’re applying for an entry-level job or looking to secure an executive position, I create CVs that make you stand out. With my expertise in the job market, I ensure your resume is tailored to meet industry-specific needs. You’ll receive a polished, ATS-friendly CV that grabs attention!\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 11: Publish Your Service</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once everything is filled out, double-check your entries and <strong>click \"Publish\"</strong>. Your service will be live and ready for clients to discover.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example Service Listing: CV Writing</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Service Title:</strong><br>\"I Will Write a Professional CV Tailored to Your Career Goals\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Category:</strong><br>Creative and Digital → CV Writing</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Price Tiers:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Basic:</strong> Tsh 10,000 - Simple CV layout (3-5 business days, 1 revision)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Standard:</strong> Tsh 20,000 - Customized CV with industry-specific content (2-3 business days, 2 revisions)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Premium:</strong> Tsh 30,000 - Executive-level CV with LinkedIn optimization and cover letter (24 hours, unlimited revisions)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Service Image:</strong><br>An image of a well-designed resume template</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Availability:</strong> 1 day notice</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Warranty:</strong> full warranty</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Service Description:</strong><br>\"I will craft a professional CV that highlights your skills and achievements, tailored specifically to your career goals. Whether you’re applying for an entry-level job or looking to secure an executive position, I create CVs that make you stand out. With my expertise in the job market, I ensure your resume is tailored to meet industry-specific needs. You’ll receive a polished, ATS-friendly CV that grabs attention!\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Final Tips for Success:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Be clear and specific</strong> about the services you offer to avoid confusion.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Use engaging language</strong> in your descriptions to make your service more appealing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Keep your prices competitive</strong> but reflect the value you provide at each tier.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Respond quickly</strong> to potential clients and deliver high-quality work to get great reviews.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now that you know how to list your service effectively, it’s time to start posting and attract your first clients on <strong>WINGA</strong>. Good luck! click a link below to list a service and earn money</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://wingatz.com/submit-listing/details\">https://wingatz.com/submit-listing/details</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','How to Effectively List Your Service on WINGA: A Step-by-Step Guide','Learn how to effectively list your service on WINGA. This guide covers everything. Read now','inherit','closed','closed','','873-revision-v1','','','2024-12-21 15:26:38','2024-12-21 15:26:38','',873,'https://wingatz.com/?p=879',0,'revision','',0),
