(886,1,'2024-12-21 15:53:19','2024-12-21 15:53:19','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Jinsi ya Kupost Huduma Yako kwa Ufanisi kwenye WINGA </strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Je, unataka kuanza kupata mapato kwa kutoa huduma zako kwenye <strong>WINGA</strong>? Hapa kuna mwongozo wa haraka wa kupost huduma yako.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 1: Nenda kwenye \"List a Service\" (Go to \"List a Service\")</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kwenda kwenye <strong>List a Service</strong> na jaza maelezo muhimu ya huduma yako.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 2: Jaza Jina la Huduma (Fill in the Service Title)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Taja huduma yako kwa ufasaha na maneno ya kutafuta.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mfano:</strong><br>“I Will Write a Professional CV Tailored to Your Career Goals”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 3: Chagua Kategoria (Choose a Category)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Chagua kategoria inayofaa, kama <strong>Writing and Translation</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 4: Weka Bei (Set Your Price)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hapa weka bei ya jumla ambayo ni basic minimum price ya huduma yako.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pia winga inakupa nafasi ya kuweka package za huduma (price tier) mfano nenda kweny <strong>tier</strong> tengeneza package tatu za huduma yako  ... mfano Anza na 1. (title) <strong>Basic</strong> (price)Tsh 10,000 - (description)Simple CV layout , then bonyeza<strong> add item </strong>ili uandike package nyingne</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2. (title)<strong>Standard</strong> (price) Tsh 20,000 - (description)Customized CV with industry-specific content, then bonyeza <strong>add item</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3. (title)<strong>Premium</strong> (price)Tsh 30,000 - (description)Executive-level CV with LinkedIn optimization and cover letter</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 5: Pakia Picha ya Huduma (Upload a Service Image)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pakia picha inayohusiana na huduma yako.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 6: Chagua wa huduma kukamilika (Choose Delivery Time)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Taja muda wa utoaji, kama <strong>up to 24 hours</strong>, <strong>2-3 days</strong>, au <strong>4-7 days</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 7: Chagua Chaguzi za Marekebisho (Select Revision Options)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Chagua idadi ya marekebisho unayotoa.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mfano:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>1 revision</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>2 revisions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Unlimited revisions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 8: Chagua Upatikanaji Wako (Set Your Availability)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Weka upatikanaji wako kwa wateja.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 9: Chagua Chaguo la Dhamana (Choose Warranty Option)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Chagua ikiwa utatoa dhamana kwa huduma yako.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 10: Andika Maelezo ya Huduma (Write a Service Description)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Elezea huduma yako na faida zake.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mfano:</strong><br>“I will craft a professional CV that highlights your skills and achievements, tailored specifically to your career goals. Whether you’re applying for an entry-level job or looking to secure an executive position, I create CVs that make you stand out.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua ya 11: Chapisha Huduma Yako (Publish Your Service)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Baada ya kuangalia tena, bonyeza <strong>Publish</strong> na huduma yako itakuwa hai.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mfano wa Huduma ya Uandishi wa CV:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Basic:</strong> Tsh 10,000 - Simple CV layout (3-5 business days, 1 revision)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Standard:</strong> Tsh 20,000 - Customized CV with industry-specific content (2-3 business days, 2 revisions)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Premium:</strong> Tsh 30,000 - Executive-level CV with LinkedIn optimization and cover letter (24 hours, unlimited revisions)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Picha ya Huduma:</strong> Picha ya muundo wa resume mzuri<br><strong>Upatikanaji:</strong> 1 day notice<br><strong>Dhamana:</strong> Full warranty<br><strong>Maelezo:</strong> “I will craft a professional CV that highlights your skills and achievements...”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vidokezo vya Mafanikio (Final Tips for Success):</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Jibu haraka kwa wateja na toa kazi ya ubora.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tumia lugha ya kuvutia kwa maelezo yako.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Weka bei yako kwa ushindani lakini iakisi thamani unayoleta.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Wakati wa kuanza!</strong> Bonyeza hapa ku <strong>List a Service</strong> <br><a href=\"https://wingatz.com/submit-listing/details\">https://wingatz.com/submit-listing/details</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Jinsi ya Kupost Huduma Yako kwa Ufanisi kwenye WINGA','Fuata hatua hizi rahisi ili kupost huduma zako kwenye WINGA. ','inherit','closed','closed','','50-revision-v1','','','2024-12-21 15:53:19','2024-12-21 15:53:19','',50,'https://wingatz.com/?p=886',0,'revision','',0),
(888,1,'2024-12-21 15:58:57','2024-12-21 15:58:57','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Jinsi ya Kuongeza Manual Price Tiers kwa Huduma Yako kwenye WINGA</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kuongeza <em>price tiers</em> (vipengele vya bei) ni njia nzuri ya kuwapa wateja wako chaguo tofauti kulingana na bajeti na huduma wanazohitaji. Hapa kuna mwongozo wa hatua kwa hatua juu ya jinsi ya kuongeza <em>price tiers</em> kwa huduma zako, tukitumia mfano wa <strong>Website Development</strong>:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua 1: Nenda kwenye Sehemu ya \" Tiers\"</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Baada ya kuingia kwenye akaunti yako ya WINGA na kuanza kutuma huduma unayotoa ,katika vepengele vya kujaza kukamilisha huduma unayotoa utaona sehemu ya <em>Tier</em>s. Hapa ndipo unapotengeneza vifurushi tofauti vya bei (<em>Basic</em>, <em>Standard</em>, <em>Premium</em>) kwa huduma yako.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua 2: Unda Package ya Kwanza - Basic</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Basic</strong> ni kiwango cha chini zaidi kinachofaa wateja wanaohitaji huduma za msingi.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Title (Jina):</strong> Basic</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Price (Bei):</strong> Tsh 200,000</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Description (Maelezo):</strong> Basic website setup with 3 pages (Home, About, Contact). Includes a responsive design and basic SEO.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bonyeza <em>Add Item</em> baada ya kujaza maelezo haya.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua 3: Unda Package ya Pili - Standard</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Standard</strong> ni kiwango cha kati kinachojumuisha huduma za ziada kuliko <em>Basic</em>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Title (Jina):</strong> Standard</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Price (Bei):</strong> Tsh 400,000</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Description (Maelezo):</strong> Fully customized website with up to 7 pages. Includes responsive design, SEO optimization, and integration of contact forms.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Baada ya kuongeza maelezo haya, bonyeza <em>Add Item</em>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua 4: Unda Package ya Tatu - Premium</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Premium</strong> ni kiwango cha juu zaidi kinachofaa wateja wanaohitaji huduma kamili na za kitaalam zaidi.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Title (Jina):</strong> Premium</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Price (Bei):</strong> Tsh 800,000</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Description (Maelezo):</strong> Advanced website with unlimited pages, e-commerce integration, advanced SEO, analytics setup, and 1-month maintenance support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bonyeza <em>Add Item</em> mara baada ya kuandika maelezo haya.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua 5: Hakikisha Maelezo ya Packages Yako</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Angalia tena maelezo ya <em>price tiers</em> zako tatu ili kuhakikisha kila moja inaeleweka vizuri. Hakikisha unatoa maelezo ya wazi kwa kila kiwango, na kila huduma inayojumuishwa.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hatua 6: Hakiki na Chapisha</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mara baada ya kumaliza kuongeza <em>price tiers</em> zako, hakikisha kila kitu kipo sahihi. Bonyeza <em>Publish</em> ili huduma yako iweze kuonekana na kuvutia wateja.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mfano wa Listing ya Huduma: Website Development</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Service Title:</strong><br>\"I Will Develop a Professional and Responsive Website for Your Business\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Category:</strong><br>Creative and Digital → Website Development</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Price Tiers:</strong><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Basic:</strong> Tsh 200,000 - Basic website setup with 3 pages (Home, About, Contact). Includes a responsive design and basic SEO.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Standard:</strong> Tsh 400,000 - Fully customized website with up to 7 pages. Includes responsive design, SEO optimization, and integration of contact forms.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Premium:</strong> Tsh 800,000 - Advanced website with unlimited pages, e-commerce integration, advanced SEO, analytics setup, and 1-month maintenance support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Service Image:</strong><br>Picha ya mfano wa tovuti iliyo tayari au screenshot ya design ya kipekee.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Service Description:</strong><br>\"I will design and develop a professional website that meets your business needs. Whether you need a simple informational site or an advanced e-commerce platform, I deliver quality work tailored to your goals. All websites are responsive, SEO-optimized, and include support for analytics setup to track your website performance.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Faida za Kuweka <em>Price Tiers</em></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Wateja Wanapata Chaguo:</strong> Wateja wanaweza kuchagua huduma inayofaa kulingana na bajeti na mahitaji yao.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Kuongeza Mapato:</strong> Vipengele vya bei tofauti hukupa nafasi ya kuvutia wateja wa viwango vyote.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Kuhakikisha Uwazi:</strong> Maelezo ya <em>price tiers</em> yanawapa wateja taarifa ya wazi juu ya huduma wanayopata kwa kila bei.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sasa unaweza kuunda na kuchapisha huduma zako kwa mafanikio kwenye WINGA. Weka <em>price tiers</em> zako vizuri ili kuvutia wateja na kupata mapato zaidi. <strong>Anza sasa kwa kubonyeza hapa:</strong><br>👉 <a href=\"https://wingatz.com/submit-listing/details\">Submit Listing on WINGA</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Jinsi ya Kuongeza package za huduma (Price Tiers) unapotuma Huduma Yako kwenye WINGA','Kuongeza price tiers (vipengele vya bei) ni njia nzuri ya kuwapa wateja wako machaguo tofauti kulingana na bajeti na huduma.','inherit','closed','closed','','1-revision-v1','','','2024-12-21 15:58:57','2024-12-21 15:58:57','',1,'https://wingatz.com/?p=888',0,'revision','',0),
