(10902,78,'description','Here\'s a more concise and simplified version:\r\n\r\n[Your Name]\r\nPrograms Manager | First Aid Instructor | Consultant | Photographer &amp; Videographer\r\n\r\nI am a Programs Manager at Tanzania Rural Health Movement, with 9 years of experience in managing healthcare projects, research, and environmental conservation in underserved communities. I am also a certified First Aid Instructor, with training in pre-hospital care across the UK, Kenya, and Tanzania.\r\n\r\nIn addition, I offer consulting services in project management, research, and administration, and have a background in Economics from Mzumbe University. I also work as a photographer and videographer, creating visual content for various projects.'),
