(14822,114,'description','1. Water Systems and Construction\r\n•	Water System Design and Installation\r\no	Involves planning, designing, and setting up water systems for residential or industrial use.\r\n•	Plumbing\r\no	Installing and maintaining pipes, fittings, and fixtures for water distribution.\r\n•	Site Foreman\r\no	Supervising construction projects, managing teams, and ensuring projects meet deadlines and quality standards.\r\n•	Water Tank Cleaning\r\no	Ensuring tanks are free of contaminants and safe for water storage.\r\n________________________________________\r\n2. Data and Office Management\r\n•	Data Entry\r\no	Inputting and maintaining accurate records in digital systems.\r\n•	Microsoft Office Suite Use\r\no	Creating documents, spreadsheets, and presentations for reports, project planning, and communication.\r\n________________________________________\r\n3. Digital and Creative Services\r\n•	Graphic Design\r\no	Creating visual content for advertisements, branding, and communication materials.\r\n•	Social Media Management\r\no	Handling online platforms to engage audiences, post content, and analyze performance metrics.\r\n•	Marketing\r\no	Developing and implementing strategies to promote products or services, often overlapping with social media efforts.'),
