(17992,145,'description','Mgogwe John\r\nProfessional Accountant &amp; Internal Auditor | Business Consultant\r\n\r\n📍 Location: Tanzania\r\n💼 Experience: 10+ Years\r\n💡 Expertise: Accounting, Auditing, Business Management, Tax &amp; Marketing Strategies\r\n\r\n🔹 About Me:\r\nI am a highly experienced Accountant and Internal Auditor with over 10 years of expertise in financial management, tax audits, internal controls, and business strategy. I specialize in helping businesses optimize their financial performance, enhance internal controls, and develop strategic plans for growth.\r\n\r\n🔹 Services I Offer:\r\n✅ Business Plan Writing – Well-structured and investor-ready business plans\r\n✅ Marketing &amp; Sales Strategies – Effective techniques to boost business growth\r\n✅ Tax Audit &amp; Compliance – Ensuring tax efficiency and regulatory adherence\r\n✅ Accounting &amp; Financial Statements – Accurate and transparent financial records\r\n✅ Business Management Consulting – Strategic advice for operational efficiency\r\n✅ Internal Control Design – Strengthening financial and operational security\r\n\r\n🔹 Why Work with Me?\r\n✔ Over a decade of professional experience\r\n✔ Expert in business growth &amp; financial management\r\n✔ Reliable, detail-oriented, and committed to client success\r\n✔ Personalized solutions tailored to your needs\r\n\r\n📩 Get in Touch:\r\n📞 Phone: 0758008775\r\n📧 Email: mgogwejohn@yahoo.com\r\n\r\nLet’s work together to take your business to the next level! 🚀'),
