(24239,221,'description','Profile – Regina Jackson\r\n\r\nJina / Brand: Regina Designs\r\n\r\nBio / Maelezo:\r\nCreative designer &amp; personal shopper. I create logos, invitation cards, social media graphics, simple branding materials, and help clients bring products to them—paid upon delivery. Affordable, reliable, and fast service!\r\n\r\nKazi / Services:\r\n\r\nLogo Design – Tsh 20,000+\r\n\r\nInvitation Cards / Kadi za Mwaliko – Tsh 10,000+\r\n\r\nSocial Media Graphics / Posts – Tsh 5,000+\r\n\r\nFlyers / Posters / Simple Ads – Tsh 15,000+\r\n\r\nSimple Branding Materials – Tsh 25,000+\r\n\r\nProduct Delivery / Bringing Goods – Client pays upon delivery\r\n\r\nDigital Art / Illustrations – Tsh 10,000+\r\n\r\nCustom Stickers / Labels – Tsh 5,000+\r\n\r\nPhoto Editing / Touch-ups – Tsh 5,000+\r\n\r\n\r\nJinsi ya Kazi ya Product Delivery:\r\n\r\nMteja unaniagiza bidhaa\r\n\r\nUnaletewa bidhaa yako kwa uaminifu\r\n\r\nMalipo yanatolewa mara moja baada ya kuleta\r\n\r\n\r\nContact / Wasiliana Naye:\r\n\r\nWhatsApp/Normal : 0624 469 221\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\n\r\nPrices flexible for multiple orders\r\n\r\nQuick and reliable service guaranteed\r\n   KARIBU'),
