(28769,279,'description','Hello! My name is Anitha, and I’m a detail-oriented professional offering a range of administrative, creative, and documentation services. I specialize in proposal writing, CV/Resume design, cover letter and application writing, and logo and business card design.\r\nI also assist clients with important document processes such as Certificate of Registration (BRELA / USAJILI WA KAMPUNI) and passport applications, ensuring accuracy, professionalism, and timely completion.\r\nWith a strong focus on quality and presentation, I take pride in delivering well-organized, visually appealing, and effective work that helps individuals and businesses achieve their goals.\r\nLet’s work together to bring your ideas to life — with clarity, creativity, and professionalism.'),
